{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557720/extras/e60889b2cc6070d2ed10f20281e67fde.avif?t=1772270859\" width=1280 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever been lost in a big, dark jungle filled with hypnotic monster girls? Now it\u2019s time to experience it with both your mind and body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster Girl Jungle</strong> is a Visual Novel mixed with Sandbox elements, a 2D Hentai Game. You explore the jungle, where you have the opportunity to meet hypnotic monster girls who want to get to know you - and test your willpower...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557720/extras/051196c2f61cc7d7ed4990e85c7d6670.avif?t=1772270859\" width=1280 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each girl has her own kinks and a unique hypnotic method to gently pull you into sweet submission through their power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some may see you as a lover, maybe as a servant - or perhaps nothing more than prey for their own amusement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Zelra</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first encounter is with <strong>Zelra</strong>, the lamia girl. Just look at her mesmerizing brown skin, those sparkling eyes, the shimmering snake scales of her lower body\u2026 but something\u2019s wrong. Her eyes begin to glow and you can\u2019t look away. Her tail slowly coils around your waist. Will you resist her\u2026 or surrender completely?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Tia</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your second encounter will be with <strong>Tia</strong>, the hellhound girl. She is currently being worked on for the next update.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\